  "notes": "JAPANESE COURT SYSTEM:\n{控訴|こうそ} specifically refers to appealing from:\n- ⟦{地方裁判所|ちほうさいばんしょ}→地方裁判所：noentry⟧ (District Court) → ⟦{高等裁判所|こうとうさいばんしょ}→高等裁判所：noentry⟧ (High Court)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{控訴審|こうそしん}→控訴審：noentry⟧: appeals trial\n- ⟦{控訴人|こうそにん}→控訴人：noentry⟧: appellant\n- ⟦{被控訴人|ひこうそにん}→被控訴人：noentry⟧: appellee\n- ⟦{控訴棄却|こうそききゃく}→控訴棄却：noentry⟧: dismissal of appeal\n\nDIFFERENCE FROM ⟦{上訴|じょうそ}→上訴：05967_jouso⟧:\n- {控訴|こうそ}: Appeal to high court (second instance)\n- ⟦{上告|じょうこく}→上告：14864_joukoku⟧: Appeal to Supreme Court (third instance)\n- ⟦{上訴|じょうそ}→上訴：05967_jouso⟧: General term for any appeal",
